// Limit is a resolved pool ceiling: what was detected, whether an operator set
// a cap, and the usable ceiling.
//
// A cap that cannot be resolved (empty, zero, malformed) is "not configured",
// never a zero limit. A zero limit would refuse every load, which is the one
